{
  "$comment": "Box 0's pin (M1-02; ADR-0017 section 10; BC-222, plan N16), refreshed by SH-V2-INT-FIX4 for F126: graduation never blocks, lossless stream retry, uninitialised clones refused. All source hashes and both profiles' creation/runtime hashes and runtime sizes come from clean builds of integration reference 85675164927e096c154d405de8f6895c54d0b38d; no production source changed in this ticket. Release artifacts use solc 0.8.26, Cancun, optimizer 1000, non-IR, bytecodeHash none; alternate v4-upstream artifacts are excluded. Code hashes are sha256 of lower-case hex without 0x (immutables zeroed). versionCodeHash includes deployed immutables and is measured by Box0CodePin.t.sol's local Sepolia Step 2 deployment in each profile. Evidence: docs/evidence/SH-V2-INT-FIX4.md. box0-pin.mjs --check checks sources, absent files and compiler settings; Box0CodePin.t.sol checks bytecode and deployment identities. candidate.pinDigest seals sources, absent and compiler; the companion v1-freeze.test.ts seals the complete code tables. Pin changes require explicit authorization and review.",
  "format": "squarehole.box0-pin/1",
  "ticket": "M1-02",
  "case": "BC-222 (plan N16)",
  "candidate": {
    "what": "F143 candidate: box 0 reads its BoxBackedSource (drand first; the RANDAO backup by an on-chain rule from 5 days to 5 days 18 hours after an unposted round, one target 256 blocks ahead, the start proving a recent block's header (one of the last 8; the security review's fix round); no owner, setter, pause, upgrade or restart). BoxTickets, DrandSource and every other src/box/ runtime code are core-v21-rc7's; only BoxFactoryV1's constructor (its source pin) and the two new randomness files changed. On top of F126 (graduation never blocks, lossless stream retry, uninitialised clones refused).",
    "merge": "85675164927e096c154d405de8f6895c54d0b38d",
    "pinnedOn": "sh-box0-backup-source (SH-BOX0-BACKUP-SOURCE; its cross-review fix round af1 refreshed the source hashes of box-spec.v1.json, BoxSpecV1.sol and BoxBackedSource.sol after comment-only edits, code tables unchanged); previous pin 85675164927e096c154d405de8f6895c54d0b38d; then sh-audit-b0-docfix (SH-AUDIT-B0-DOCFIX, box 0's own review, F147) refreshed the source hashes of box-spec.v1.json and thirteen src/box files after comment-only edits, code tables unchanged",
